can you please go through this proposal and then layout the project directory and create a todo list to start working on this , everything has to be of production grade without any compromising in any quality etc # YouTube Creation Studio — Full Local Pipeline Plan

A single self-hosted project that turns raw material (a topic, a doc, or slide content) into a full YouTube pipeline: PPT → narrated video → transcript → chapters/timestamps → SEO metadata → auto-generated Shorts. Everything runs on your machine except the LLM calls you choose to make (Claude for scripting/metadata).

Companion piece to your existing [Vantage](https://www.tryvantage.site) tool — Vantage already solves "long video → keyword-targeted clips." This plan folds that in as one module (`shorts/`) rather than rebuilding it, and adds everything upstream of it: script → slides → narrated video → transcript.

