## 5. Hardware & cost reality check

- **GPU**: RTX 3060 12GB or better runs Chatterbox + WhisperX comfortably. No GPU → still works, just slower (rent a RunPod/Vast.ai GPU at ~$0.20–0.60/hr only for the render session).
- **Your volume (6–7 videos/month, 10+ min each ≈ 70–100 min narration + transcription/month)**: trivially inside free/local capacity. ElevenLabs would run you into $22–44+/month at that volume (well past the Creator tier); this setup keeps it near $0.
- **Time cost**: real, especially the first build (expect a weekend or two to get stages 1-6 solid). After that, each video is mostly unattended compute time.

